From: Androlinzberg maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] UriMetricsHelper: permit a host without a statistics service

Retain the stock grant implementation and metrics accounting. Pull registration
is optional at the host service boundary, where no stats daemon is published.

--- a/services/core/java/com/android/server/uri/UriMetricsHelper.java
+++ b/services/core/java/com/android/server/uri/UriMetricsHelper.java
@@ -47,6 +47,9 @@
 
     void registerPuller() {
         final StatsManager statsManager = mContext.getSystemService(StatsManager.class);
+        // Hosted system-server has no stats daemon/StatsManager capability.
+        // The grant state machine and persistence do not depend on a puller.
+        if (statsManager == null) return;
         statsManager.setPullAtomCallback(
                 FrameworkStatsLog.PERSISTENT_URI_PERMISSIONS_AMOUNT_PER_PACKAGE,
                 DAILY_PULL_METADATA,
